* LT3045-1 5V to 3.3V LDO, 100mA resistive load
.lib LT3045-1.sub

V1 IN 0 DC 5
CIN IN 0 10u

XU1 IN IN PG PGFB SET ILIM 0 OUT OUT VIOC LT3045-1

RSET SET 0 33.2k
CSET SET 0 10n
RILIM ILIM 0 1k

RPG PG OUT 100k
RPGFB1 OUT PGFB 100k
RPGFB2 PGFB 0 10k

COUT OUT 0 10u
RLOAD OUT 0 33

.tran 0 100m 50m
.meas tran vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM 80m TO 100m

.end
